ce into", "display_url": "isaaa.org/kc/cropbiotech…", "end": 187, "expanded_url": "https://www.isaaa.org/kc/cropbiotechupdate/ged/article/default.asp?ID=22018", "images": [{"height": 800, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116043403775578112/Snb4d4cz?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116043403775578112/Snb4d4cz?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 164, "status": 200, "title": "Korean Rice Cultivar Gains Glufosinate Resistance Through Prime Editing", "unwound_url": "https://www.isaaa.org/kc/cropbiotechupdate/ged/article/default.asp?ID=22018", "url": "https://t.co/KPeOCE5mz2"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/w7nD2HTQbX", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/FSII_India/status/2116043389200417239/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116037101083152384", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/w7nD2HTQbX"}]}, "id": "2116043389200417239", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 28, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Prime editing gave South Korea’s Dongjin rice glufosinate tolerance by modifying OsGS1;1, with no foreign transgenes retained. Tested only at seedling stage.\nRead: https://t.co/KPeOCE5mz2 \n@isaaa_org \n#GeneEditing #RiceResearch #FSII #VoiceOfTheSeed #BeejKiBaat #FutureFriday https://t.co/w7nD2HTQbX", "url": "https://x.com/FSII_India/status/2116043389200417239"}, {"author_id": "818008252814217217", "created_at": "2026-10-28T22:58:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115579052417560942"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "doi.org/10.1016/j.micr…", "end": 216, "expanded_url": "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.micres.2026.128697", "start": 193, "unwound_url": "https://www.sciencedirect.com/user/error/ATN-20?errorContext=arp-83c30cee-1a39-49c8-b2bd-414f7182bbd5", "url": "https://t.co/j1P4MjeRu9"}]}, "id": "2115579052417560942", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 406, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "“Design of base editing systems with tunable editing hotspots within a defined window through sgRNA engineering”\nWenliang Hao [..] Zhemin Zhou, Chong Zhang.\nMicrobiol Res. 2026-08-25/2027 Jan.\nhttps://t.co/j1P4MjeRu9", "url": "https://x.com/ScienceCrisp/status/2115579052417560942"}, {"author_id": "1172117503", "created_at": "2026-10-29T15:20:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115826027578408984"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 227, "start": 214, "tag": "PrimeEditing"}, {"end": 240, "start": 228, "tag": "Gentherapie"}], "urls": [{"description": "Prime Editing im Körper: Ein erster Patient erhielt PM577a. Eine Infusion soll die Wilson-Mutation H1069Q in der Leber korrigieren, die Wirkung ist noch offen.", "display_url": "forschung-und-wissen.de/nachrichten/me…", "end": 213, "expanded_url": "https://www.forschung-und-wissen.de/nachrichten/medizin/erstmals-erhaelt-ein-mensch-ein-mittel-das-dna-im-koerper-umschreiben-soll-133715221", "images": [{"height": 708, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115826033035255808/gIbFJkdL?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115826033035255808/gIbFJkdL?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 190, "status": 200, "title": "Erstmals erhält ein Mensch ein Mittel, das DNA im Körper umschreiben soll", "unwound_url": "https://www.forschung-und-wissen.de/nachrichten/medizin/erstmals-erhaelt-ein-mensch-ein-mittel-das-dna-im-koerper-umschreiben-soll-133715221", "url": "https://t.co/9pFNJyOodI"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/iXapsUBcNl", "end": 264, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ForschungWissen/status/2115826027578408984/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115826025003155456", "start": 241, "url": "https://t.co/iXapsUBcNl"}]}, "id": "2115826027578408984", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Erstmals hat ein Mensch eine Pr